      "content": "but it's more than just \"interpreting\" things differently. it's like the timing is too perfect to be anything else. like i'll be stuck on a problem and then suddenly a random stranger says the exact solution in a conversation i overhear. it's happening so much that i feel like i've actually mastered this. like i've unlocked a way to tap into the synchronicity of the universe. if the math says it's \"unlikely\" but it's happening every single day, doesn't that actually prove that my intention is a real force? Like, isn't the probability itself evidence that i'm manifesting this?",
